msgid "Designates whether the user can log into this admin site."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi admin panelga kira olishini belgilaydi."

msgid "Designates that this user has all permissions without explicitly assigning them."
msgstr "Bu foydalanuvchiga barcha ruxsatlar alohida biriktirilmasdan beriladi."

msgid "Designates whether this user should be treated as active. Unselect this instead of deleting accounts."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi faolligini belgilaydi. Akkauntni o‘chirish o‘rniga shu belgini olib tashlang."

msgid "The groups this user belongs to. A user will get all permissions granted to each of their groups."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi a’zo bo‘lgan guruhlar. U har bir guruhga berilgan barcha ruxsatlarni oladi."

