msgstr "Parol orqali kirish"

msgid "Password-based authentication was disabled."
msgstr "Parol orqali kirish o‘chirildi."

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Yoqilgan"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "O‘chirilgan"

msgid "Raw passwords are not stored, so there is no way to see the user’s password."
msgstr "Parollar ochiq holda saqlanmaydi, shuning uchun foydalanuvchi parolini ko‘rib bo‘lmaydi."

msgid "Password confirmation"
msgstr "Parolni tasdiqlang"

msgid "Enter the same password as before, for verification."
msgstr "Tekshirish uchun yuqoridagi parolni qayta kiriting."

msgid "Required. 150 characters or fewer. Letters, digits and @/./+/-/_ only."
msgstr "Majburiy. 150 belgigacha. Faqat harflar, raqamlar va @/./+/-/_ belgilari."
